abstract: >
  Home sales data analytics project using Python for exploratory data
  analysis and linear regression. The project examines relationships
  among home price, square footage, bedrooms, bathrooms, year built,
  neighborhood, property type, and satisfaction. The analysis includes
  data preparation, exploratory visualization, correlation analysis,
  baseline comparison, linear regression modeling, model evaluation,
  residual analysis, and communication of findings through a
  reproducible professional workflow.

